Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: AYN: do not wake on volume up

Adapted from Armada wake-source policy; do not change SD timings.
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs8550-ayn-common.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/qcs8550-ayn-common.dtsi
@@ -51,7 +51,6 @@
 			gpios = <&pm8550_gpios 6 GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW>;
 			linux,code = <KEY_VOLUMEUP>;
 			linux,can-disable;
-			wakeup-source;
 		};
 	};
 
